# Russian gender from the last letter: он, она, оно
subtitle: "Every Russian noun is a he, a she or an it, and its last letter tells you which: он, она or оно, with the one exception worth knowing."
thumb: "band \"Even a table is a he\" note \"СТОЛ = ОН\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | a warm, patient language teacher, clear and unhurried; says every Russian word the way a native Russian speaker would"}
next: {"title":"Hello in Russian: привет or здравствуйте?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/03-russian-hello.cast"}

