    card title "ОН · ОНА́ · ОНО́"

In Russian, every noun is a he, a she or an it — even a table.
    draw h_on h_ona h_ono

So which is a book, or a window?
    draw pic_book pic_window pic_q

In French you would memorise each word; Russian gives you a clue.
    highlight h_on h_ona h_ono

    erase pic_book pic_window pic_q

Start with three words from lesson one: дом, кот and суп are all он.
    draw c_dom dom_s dom_k dom_g c_kot kot_s kot_k kot_g c_sup sup_s sup_k sup_g

And мама and вода, mum and water, are both она.
    draw c_mama mama_s mama_k mama_g c_voda voda_s voda_k voda_g

    quiz "What decides whether a noun is он or она?"
        intro: Before I tell you, make a guess.
        right: Its last letter: дом, кот and суп end in a consonant, мама and вода end in а.
        wrong: Compare how the words in each row end.
        * Its first letter
        + Its last letter
        * How long it is

    hide dom_k kot_k sup_k

Here is the clue, at the very end: дом, кот and суп end in a consonant.
    draw dom_e kot_e sup_e

And a consonant ending makes a noun он.
    highlight dom_e kot_e sup_e h_on color #2f6b8f

Here is a new word: стол, a table.
    draw c_stol stol_s stol_e stol_g

It ends in Л, a new letter that says l, so a table is он.
    highlight stol_e color #2f6b8f

    hide mama_k voda_k

Мама and вода end in а, and an а ending makes a noun она.
    draw mama_e voda_e

Книга, a book, brings another new letter: Г, which says g.
    draw c_kniga kniga_s kniga_g

It ends in а as well, so a book is она.
    draw kniga_e

Я, which says ya, is а's twin: неделя, a week, is она too.
    draw c_nedelya nedelya_s nedelya_e nedelya_g

The third ending is о or е, and it makes a noun оно: it.
    draw c_okno okno_s okno_e okno_g c_moloko moloko_s moloko_e moloko_g c_more more_s more_e more_g

Окно is a window, молоко is milk, and море is the sea: all three are оно.
    blocking false

    highlight okno_e color #8a5fa8 duration 1.4

    highlight moloko_e color #8a5fa8 duration 1.4

    highlight more_e color #8a5fa8 duration 1.6

One honest exception: папа, dad, ends in а, yet he is он.
    draw c_papa papa_s papa_e papa_g

For a man, the meaning wins over the ending.
    highlight c_papa color #2f6b8f effect circle

    erase board h_on h_ona h_ono

    draw sort

    ask "Put each word in its box: он, она or оно." on sort store s stage own
        intro: Now mix them up, the way you will meet them.
        right: {s} right on the first try.
        wrong: {s} of {s.total} on the first try; the last letter decides, except for папа.

    erase sort sort_1 sort_2 sort_3 sort_4 sort_5 sort_6

    draw k_card k_s k_k k_g

    ask "Окно́ means window. Type its pronoun." answer ["ОНО"] keys АКМОТВЕНРСУДИПЛГЯ translit true
        right: Оно: окно ends in о.
        wrong: Look at the last letter of окно.

    hide k_k

    draw k_e k_pron parallel true

    erase k_card k_s k_e k_g k_pron

    ask "Type any noun from this lesson that is она." answer ["КНИГА","МАМА","ВОДА","НЕДЕЛЯ"] keys АКМОТВЕНРСУДИПЛГЯ
        right: Книга, мама, вода or неделя: each one ends in а or я.
        wrong: Think of a word that ends in а, but not dad.

    show h_on h_ona h_ono board

So you don't learn a gender for every noun: you read it off the last letter, and only a few words, like папа, let the meaning win.
    blocking false

    highlight dom_e kot_e sup_e stol_e color #2f6b8f duration 1.2

    highlight mama_e voda_e kniga_e nedelya_e color #b5482e duration 1.2

    highlight okno_e moloko_e more_e color #8a5fa8 duration 1.2

    highlight c_papa color #2f6b8f effect circle duration 1.8

    erase board h_on h_ona h_ono

Here are three words you have never seen: парк, a park; лампа, a lamp; and вино, wine.
    draw transfer

    ask "Which one is оно? Tap it." choose ["t_park","t_lampa","t_vino"] answer t_vino
        right: Вино ends in о, so wine is оно.
        wrong: Forget what it means: look only at its last letter.

    hide tpark_k tlampa_k tvino_k

Парк ends in a consonant, so it is он; лампа in а, so она; and вино in о, so оно.
    draw tpark_e tpark_p tlampa_e tlampa_p tvino_e tvino_p vino_ring

    erase transfer tpark_e tpark_p tlampa_e tlampa_p tvino_e tvino_p vino_ring

And lesson one's ресторан? It ends in Н, so it is он.
    draw r_s r_n r_gl

But мама в ресторане means mum is in the restaurant,
    text r_in "в ресторане = in the restaurant" #8f887c x 500 y 270 font_size 34

and ресторан gained an е: an ending at work.
    draw r_e

How endings change is the next lesson's story.
    highlight r_e color #d0865f effect underline

